eight-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"9d7585a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5b9e169\" data-id=\"5b9e169\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7dcbdd7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7dcbdd7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><div class=\"border-borderMain\/50 ring-borderMain\/50 divide-borderMain\/50 dark:divide-borderMainDark\/50  dark:ring-borderMainDark\/50 dark:border-borderMainDark\/50 bg-transparent\"><div class=\"mb-md\"><div class=\"relative default font-sans text-base text-textMain dark:text-textMainDark selection:bg-super\/50 selection:text-textMain dark:selection:bg-superDuper\/10 dark:selection:text-superDark\"><div class=\"min-w-0 break-words [word-break:break-word]\"><div dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"prose dark:prose-invert inline leading-normal break-words min-w-0 [word-break:break-word]\"><p class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg first:mt-3\"><strong>Centralized Cloud Management<\/strong><\/p>Sophos Central \u2013 the ultimate cloud management platform for cybersecurity \u2013 is free and easy to use.<p class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg first:mt-3\"><strong>Single Console Management<\/strong><\/p>Sophos Central provides a single cloud management console for all your Sophos products and includes group firewall management at no additional cost.<p class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg first:mt-3\"><strong>Cloud Reporting<\/strong><\/p>Sophos Central retains your firewall log data in the cloud with flexible reporting tools that allow you to analyze and visualize your network over time.<p class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg first:mt-3\"><strong>Deployment with Predefined Configuration<\/strong><\/p>Sophos Central enables easy deployment of new Sophos Firewall devices from a predefined configuration.<p class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg first:mt-3\"><strong>Synchronize Your Security<\/strong><\/p>The Sophos Firewall ecosystem offers unique advanced benefits that enhance your protection, network security, and multiply your team&#8217;s capabilities.<p class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg first:mt-3\"><strong>Synchronize Your Protection<\/strong><\/p>The Sophos Firewall seamlessly integrates with the rest of the Sophos ecosystem, including ZTNA and Intercept X Endpoint, to provide MTR, XDR, and Synchronized Security with extraordinary visibility, protection, and response benefits, whether managed by you or by Sophos.<p class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg first:mt-3\"><strong>Extend Your Network<\/strong><\/p>The Sophos Firewall allows you to expand your network anywhere easily and cost-effectively with a complete portfolio of secure access solutions for SD-WAN, cloud, and VPN that will integrate your distributed network.<p class=\"mb-2 mt-6 text-lg first:mt-3\"><strong>Multiply Your Team&#8217;s Capacity<\/strong><\/p>The Sophos Firewall ecosystem with Synchronized Security and Sophos Central has come together to help you save time, effort, and substantial resources in managing IT security effectively doubling the size of your IT team.<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"mt-sm flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"-ml-sm flex items-center gap-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center min-w-0 justify-center gap-xs\"><div class=\"text-align-center relative truncate leading-loose\">Compartilhar<\/div><\/div><div class=\"flex items-center min-w-0 justify-center gap-xs\"><div class=\"text-align-center relative truncate leading-loose\">Reescrever<\/div><\/div><\/div>